sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as GEX Manager (background)
    participant D as Deribit mainnet (public-only gateway)
    participant GM as GammaMonitor
    participant S as Strategy

    loop every 60 s
        G->>D: public/get_book_summary_by_currency (OI, mark IV, future price per expiry)
        G->>G: strike, expiry, type from instrument names · nearest 5 expiries · strikes ±gex_strike_range_pct
        G->>G: Black-Scholes gamma × OI × spot² per strike · weight expiries · consolidate
        alt gex_method = script (default)
            G->>G: flip = lowest crossing · regime = sign of summed GEX
        else gex_method = nearest_flip
            G->>G: flip = crossing nearest spot · regime = spot vs flip, hysteresis band
        end
        G->>G: publish new immutable Snapshot
    end

    S->>GM: PushPrice(index price) — daily closes for swing / SMA trend
    S->>GM: Evaluate()
    GM->>G: Snapshot()
    GM-->>S: GammaDecision (Action, Regime, Flip, Trend)
    alt NEGATIVE regime, spot < flip, bear trend
        S->>S: ClosePuts — close puts, skip put entries and repairs
    else NEGATIVE regime, spot < flip, bull trend
        S->>S: CloseCalls — close calls, skip call entries and repairs
    else otherwise
        S->>S: ActionNone — trade both legs
    end
